% G1-HIGH: PHASE 7, CODE PAST THE OLD WINDOW SURVIVES IMAGE.  W1 AND W3
% SIT PAST R8+7FFF, W4 AT CODE_0+20100; W4 CALLS W3 WITH JSB L^.  G1 IS
% MADE WITH ITS CODE POINTER 0E PAST THAT, SO ITS CODE ISD ENDS ON THE
% NEXT PAGE BOUNDARY.  CODE_0 IS R8-8000.
'IMGUTIL.STO LOAD
HEX
0 R8@+ 8000 + 10 - CODE_PNTR !
'W2 : 77 ;
'W1 : 1 2 + 3 4 + 5 6 + 7 8 + + + + ;
'W3 : W1 W2 + ;
0 R8@+ 8000 - 20100 + CODE_PNTR !
'W4 : W3 W1 + ;
"W4 " MSG W4 = CR
'W3 WHERE CR 'W4 WHERE CR
'G1.TMP IMAGE
IORB<<
HINFO SHOW
>
PTRS
